{"id":"wddtw","title":"Weighted DTW on differences","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"This variant first takes adjacent differences and then uses displacement-weighted DTW. It combines sensitivity to local changes with a preference for smaller index displacement. The displayed derivative table and weighted path belong to that stated composition, which need not equal every library's WDDTW convention.","intro_zh":"该变体先计算相邻差分，再进行位移加权 DTW，结合局部变化比较与较小索引位移偏好。图中导数表和加权路径对应这里明确给出的组合，不保证与所有库的 WDDTW 约定相同。","steps_en":["Take first differences with the stated convention.","Compute local squared discrepancies; apply the indicated weights or admissibility mask.","At each admissible cell, add its local cost to the smallest predecessor cost.","Trace one minimizing path and take the square root of its accumulated objective."],"steps_zh":["按明确约定计算一阶差分。","计算局部平方误差，并施加指定权重或允许匹配的掩码。","在每个允许单元格，把局部代价加到三个前驱的最小累计代价上。","回溯一条最小化目标的路径，并对其累计目标值取平方根。"],"formula":"d=sqrt(min_path sum w(|i-j|)*(Delta x_i-Delta y_j)^2), g=0.6","caveats_en":["Both derivative estimation and the logistic slope change the answer; offset tolerance does not imply robustness to arbitrary noise.","Signal scale, path constraints and final normalization must match before distances from different tools are compared."],"caveats_zh":["导数估计和逻辑权重斜率都会改变结果；容忍水平偏移并不意味着对任意噪声稳健。","比较不同工具的数值之前，须统一信号尺度、路径约束和最终归一化。"],"sources":[{"label":"aeon: logistic weighted DTW","url":"https://www.aeon-toolkit.org/en/stable/api_reference/auto_generated/aeon.distances.wdtw_distance.html"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"local_cost":"squared Euclidean","final_square_root":true,"normalization":"none","derivative"